# CODEOWNERS
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review on pull requests.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Default owner for everything in the repo.
# The "*" pattern matches all files unless a more specific rule below overrides it.
* @vaishalgandhi

# --- Optional: more specific rules ---
# Uncomment and adjust any of these if you want different reviewers for
# different parts of the project. More specific paths take precedence over "*".

# Only require review on changes to core gameplay scripts
# /scripts/ @your-github-username

# Only require review on changes to project settings / config
# /project.godot @your-github-username

# Exclude generated/cache folders from requiring review (not usually needed
# since .gitignore should already keep these out of the repo)
# /.godot/
